addGameWindow
title=Add a Game
'Button Names
folder={globals, stfs} Folder Import
manual=Manual Import
back=Back to Menu
'Button Descriptions
folderDesc=Import a game with it's parent folder/directory.\n\nNOTE: The game must be in {globals, god} format with a valid\n{globals, stfs} header, with the original {globals, x360} folder\nstructure. See {globals, fullname}'s Wiki pages on\n{globals, git} for more information.\n\nThis method will auto-import {globals, tid}s, which can be\nused for Database Lookups.
manualDesc=Directly provide a filepath to a game file,\neither in {globals, stfs}/{globals, god} format or {globals, xex}\nformat.